## Step 1: Dump the MTN Manifests and Configuration Strings
Run this command to create dedicated structural dumps for both MTN apps so we can read their configurations:

cd /home/user/Downloads/waydroid_extracted_apks
for app in com.mtn.mtncmr3 mtnft.momo.consumer; do
    echo "Processing $app..."
    aapt dump xmltree "$app.apk" AndroidManifest.xml > "${app}_manifest.txt"
    aapt dump strings "$app.apk" > "${app}_strings.txt"done

